WEBVTT

00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:01.410
Start on Sales Hub.

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:03.010
This is your overview.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:04.850
Read the labels beside the

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.090
numbers so you know whether

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:07.390
you're looking at inventory,

00:00:07.390 --> 00:00:09.140
posting activity or something

00:00:09.140 --> 00:00:10.160
that needs attention.

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:11.790
The main navigation

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:12.980
stays on the left.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.540
Move down to Post

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.060
to Market and click it.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:17.080
This is where

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.280
you'll find your vehicles.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.960
Available, Queue and Posted

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.220
to FB sit across the

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.380
top of the working area.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.360
They separate vehicles you

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.180
can choose, work in progress,

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.720
and listings you've posted.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.890
Next, click Listing

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:32.430
Updates in the left sidebar.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.360
This page brings together

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.850
price changes and vehicles

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:36.870
that are no longer

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.110
in the connected inventory.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.120
Now click Configuration.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.180
The tabs here include Facebook,

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:44.480
Inventory Feeds and Post Style.

00:00:44.650 --> 00:00:45.670
You'll use these

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:46.690
for your connections

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.710
and listing settings.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:48.830
Other tabs

00:00:48.830 --> 00:00:49.880
depend on your access.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.500
Product Tour is at

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:52.920
the bottom left, and Support

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:54.420
is also in the sidebar.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.670
Pause the video

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:57.140
and find those four destinations

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.150
yourself: Post to Market,

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.230
Listing Updates,

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.470
Configuration and Product Tour.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:03.490
You don't need

00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:04.510
to change anything.
